  "description": "Picture-perfect high school sweethearts Na-Eun Gwon and Seon-Ho Ji split up on graduation day -- leaving Na-Eun puzzled and heartbroken. Five years later, Seon-Ho is an A-list superstar, while Na-Eun is a struggling actress desperate for her big break. When Na-Eun lands a lead role in a high-profile romantic comedy alongside her ex, she proposes a high-stakes bet: whoever falls in love first buys the other a house! As real-life feelings blur with their on-screen romance, can Na-Eun keep her cool on set?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
